                <pb facs="1236" n="1226" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1226"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">120.301/2–449: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stuart</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-02-04T20:00:00-05:00">February 4, 1949—8
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>178. Urtel 315 Feb 5. As Service Attachés part of Amb’s staff, Amb shld instruct
                    Attachés that their dependents are subject same restrictions re return China
                    mainland as other Emb officers and employees. Deptel 157 Feb 2 (rptd Manila 130)
                    and Deptel 171 Feb 4 (rptd [<hi rendition="#italic">sent</hi>] Manila 146) shld
                    therefore apply equally to dependents Service Attachés.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
